    "text": "Let G be an m-generated group the elementary theory of which T h(G) coin-\ncides with the elementary theory T h(F ) of a free soluble group F of derived length\nn ⩾ 3 of finite rank r ⩾ 2. Must the groups G and F be isomorphic?\n    The answer is affirmative if m ⩽ r or n = 2                    E. I. Timoshenko",
